  packagingTypes  String[]
  isActive        Boolean   @default(true)
  // ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // CENTRALISED PRICING (admin-controlled).
  //   `pricePerUnit` is the AUTHORITATIVE selling price per unit (kg, etc).
  //   - Farmers cannot set or override it; they only manage availableQty.
  //   - Orders price from this field, NOT from FarmerCatalogItem.pricePerUnit.
  //   - When null, the product is not yet priced and orders are rejected
  //     with a clear "Awaiting admin price" error.
  //   - Set by the Admin via PATCH /products/:id/price (audit-logged).
  // priceFloor / priceCeiling remain as guard-rails for legacy flows.
  // ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  pricePerUnit    Decimal?  @db.Decimal(15, 4)
  priceUpdatedAt  DateTime?
  priceUpdatedBy  String?   @db.Uuid
